WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.950
She doesn't book the travel or the itinerary.

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:06.908
She really is just a coach. She's someone who will help you to think

00:00:06.908 --> 00:00:07.320
through

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:11.965
destinations, ask the right questions, and help you arrive at

00:00:11.965 --> 00:00:16.010
a decision that works for you and for your situation.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:19.530
And we had an example recently when we were talking about

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.654
Vietnam, and trying to look for the cost of the visa, and I

00:00:22.654 --> 00:00:25.986
thought it was $25, but Maria challenged, and she was like, no,

00:00:25.986 --> 00:00:29.214
I don't think so. And this is where her experience then comes

00:00:29.214 --> 00:00:32.547
in, and she's like, that doesn't sound right, can you please go

00:00:32.547 --> 00:00:33.640
back and check again?

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.362
And truly, truly, we found that traveling on a Kenyan passport to

00:00:37.362 --> 00:00:41.085
Vietnam is a bit more complex, and you need an intermediary to be

00:00:41.085 --> 00:00:44.807
able to get that sorted for you, and that takes time and the cost

00:00:44.807 --> 00:00:45.540
can build up.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.779
So with her help, we were able to explore other potential

00:00:49.779 --> 00:00:53.841
destinations, and now we're planning to do a trip to Cape Town

00:00:53.841 --> 00:00:54.550
next month.

